<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 579.73, off 0.66.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 271 to 248.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,200,870, compared with 21,741,590 Friday.</p>
<p>	    (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
